{"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Modules and protocol bindings","modules":[{"name":"Skein"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein\/BindingsAndLifetimes","doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein\/Qualifiers"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein\/ModulesAndProtocolBindings","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"reference","overridingTitle":"Documentation index","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Documentation index"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein","isActive":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Modules keep registrations close to the feature that owns them. Application builders accept individual modules, arrays, optionals, conditions, and loops directly.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import Skein","","protocol HTTPClient {","    func get(path: String) throws -> String","}","","final class URLSessionClient: HTTPClient {","    func get(path: String) throws -> String { \"response\" }","}","","final class ArticleRepository {","    private let client: any HTTPClient","","    init(client: any HTTPClient) {","        self.client = client","    }","}","","let networking = module {","    single((any HTTPClient).self, provider: { _ in URLSessionClient() })","}","","let articles = module {","    factory(ArticleRepository.self, using: ArticleRepository.init)","}","","try startSkein {","    networking","    articles","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The binding key is the declared type, not the concrete type returned by the provider. Register a protocol existential such as "},{"code":"(any HTTPClient).self","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when consumers depend on the protocol. Resolve the same declared type inside providers and at call sites."}]},{"code":["let client = try get((any HTTPClient).self)","let repository: ArticleRepository = try get()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All modules are collected during application creation. Registering the same type and qualifier twice, whether in one module or separate modules, fails creation with a source-aware "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SkeinConfigurationError"},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"underlying"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SkeinError.duplicateBinding"},{"type":"text","text":". Use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein\/Qualifiers","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when multiple implementations of one type are intentional."}]},{"anchor":"Test-or-environment-overlays","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Test or environment overlays"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"overriding(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" creates a reusable module where registrations in the overlay replace exact binding keys from the base module. Duplicates within either input module still fail when an application is created.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let production = module {","    single((any HTTPClient).self, provider: { _ in URLSessionClient() })","}","final class PreviewHTTPClient: HTTPClient {","    func get(path: String) throws -> String { \"preview\" }","}","let preview = module {","    single((any HTTPClient).self, provider: { _ in PreviewHTTPClient() })","}","","let previewApplication = try SkeinApplication {","    production.overriding(preview)","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/skein\/modulesandprotocolbindings"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein"]]},"references":{"doc://Skein/documentation/Skein":{"abstract":[{"text":"Skein is a small, type-safe dependency-injection container for Swift.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"Skein","identifier":"doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein","url":"\/documentation\/skein","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Skein/documentation/Skein/BindingsAndLifetimes":{"abstract":[{"isActive":true,"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Documentation index"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein","type":"reference","overridingTitle":"Documentation index"}],"title":"Bindings and lifetimes","kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/skein\/bindingsandlifetimes","identifier":"doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein\/BindingsAndLifetimes"},"doc://Skein/documentation/Skein/GettingStarted":{"title":"Getting started","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/skein\/gettingstarted","identifier":"doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein\/GettingStarted","role":"article","abstract":[{"overridingTitle":"Documentation index","identifier":"doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein","isActive":true,"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Documentation index","type":"text"}],"type":"reference"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Skein/documentation/Skein/Qualifiers":{"abstract":[{"isActive":true,"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Documentation index"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein","type":"reference","overridingTitle":"Documentation index"}],"title":"Qualifiers","kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/skein\/qualifiers","identifier":"doc:\/\/Skein\/documentation\/Skein\/Qualifiers"}}}